  "body": "What: Keep a library of leftover sheets (outline, material, thickness, grain). A later nest can pick a remnant as its sheet. Used remnants leave the library.\n\nWhy: Mozaik and SWOOD keep a remnant library. #2164 covers one irregular remnant sheet and its export, but not a store between jobs.\n\nSources: https://www.mozaiksoftware.com/products/mozaik-cnc , https://www.goengineer.com/swood/nesting\n\nPart of #2395. Builds on #2164. Needs design: where the library lives (project file or user data).\n\nDone means: a design comment, then a test where a nest leaves a remnant, the remnant enters the library, and a second nest places parts on it.\n",
